{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"knightly-salty-orangutan","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Problem\n\nThe live prompt-eval loop in `.github/workflows/prompt-eval.yml` (`eval-live`) calls `rebar.llm.evals.eval.run_eval` on every dataset-bearing spec under `src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/`. Three of those specs have no solver, so every case is recorded as a run error and the spec reports coverage 0.00:\n\n| spec | cases (at `REBAR_EVAL_MAX_CASES=12`, 3 epochs) | message |\n|---|---|---|\n| plan-review-container | 36 | `run error: no eval solver for prompt 'plan-review-container'` |\n| plan-review-finder | 36 | `run error: no eval solver for prompt 'plan-review-finder'` |\n| plan-review-isf-finder | 12 | `run error: no eval solver for prompt 'plan-review-isf-finder'` |\n\nThe error is raised at `src/rebar/llm/evals/eval_solver.py:423` after no prompt-id branch matches.\n\n## Reproduction (measured 2026-11-09, origin/main 872e7f6c3fd)\n\nInside a local gate session (needed because of open bug `dissocial-unpleasant-adouri`), run `run_eval(pid, max_cases=12, repo_root=root)` for each of the three prompt ids with `AWS_PROFILE=frontier-bedrock`. Each JUnit file carries only the message above.\n\n## Expected\n\nEither each dataset-bearing spec resolves to a solver, or the loop skips specs that a different harness owns and says so, so a 0.00 coverage result means \"scored nothing\" only when something actually failed to score.\n\n## Notes\n\nFound while recording the before/after prompt evals for the model upgrade. Whether these specs are meant to be run by another harness (for example the criterion or replay harnesses) was not checked.","id":"3952-3e5b-96bd-4ce0","parent_id":"","priority":3,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"Live prompt-eval loop has no solver for plan-review-container, -finder and -isf-finder specs (coverage 0.00)"},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1794264431405575001,"uuid":"2fca25d6-93b5-47af-b562-609f261b5301"}